[00:00.00] 作词 : Bastian Langebæk/Max Wolfgang/Deschanel Gordon/Olivia Dean
[00:00.00][by:stillworkingonit]
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Bastian Langebæk/Max Wolfgang/Deschanel Gordon/Olivia Dean
[00:06.98]Thought I was done with this feeling
[00:06.98]原以为已摆脱这种感受
[00:12.05]Really thought you could be him
[00:12.05]真心以为你会是那个人
[00:16.67]Thought I was safe
[00:16.67]原以为已获得安稳
[00:24.45]You were the warmth that I needed
[00:24.45]你曾是我渴求的温暖
[00:29.65]Like a breeze in the evening
[00:29.65]如晚风般轻柔拂面
[00:34.11]And then you changed
[00:34.11]而你变了模样
[00:37.05]You're all the same, yeah
[00:37.05]你们都如此相似
[00:41.83]It's too much to mend
[00:41.83]裂痕已难以修补
[00:46.06]You're the hug that had to end
[00:46.06]你是必须结束的拥抱
[00:52.28]Though I've tried to hold on
[00:52.28]尽管我曾努力坚守
[00:59.30]And if you knew me at all
[00:59.30]若你真正了解我
[01:03.38]You wouldn't try to keep me small
[01:03.38]就不会试图压抑我的光芒
[01:10.11]Who would do that to a friend
[01:10.11]谁会如此对待朋友
[01:12.63]Let alone the one you love?
[01:12.63]更何况深爱之人？
[01:21.56]And any choice you had worth making
[01:21.56]任何值得把握的选择
[01:26.78]I'd push you to take it
[01:26.78]我都会鼓励你争取
[01:31.19]No questions asked
[01:31.19]无需追问缘由
[01:33.51]No doubt in mind
[01:33.51]不必心存疑虑
[01:35.44]But when they're mine, yeah
[01:35.44]但当涉及我的权益
[01:38.87]You react like I'm crossing a line
[01:38.87]你却反应激烈如我越界
[01:44.34]I'm too much to handle and
[01:44.34]你觉得我难以应付
[01:46.82]Just dial it back a bit
[01:46.82]要求我收敛锋芒
[01:49.45]Well, well I'm not having it, babe
[01:49.45]但我绝不妥协 亲爱的
[01:56.40]It's too much to mend
[01:56.40]裂痕已难以修补
